  "description": "ZAPVOE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H104 Dy8 N64 O8,24(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 2 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 2 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 2 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 2 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 2 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 2 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 2 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.960-4.047 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 118.19-125.44°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C128H152Dy8N64O32.",
